  "body": "# Actual text\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#media-elements:idl-object\r\n> object getStartDate\\(\\);\r\n\r\n# Proposed text\r\n> Date getStartDate\\(\\);\r\n\r\n# Rationale\r\n- The description of the method says that it _must return a new Date object_, see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#dom-media-getstartdate.\r\n- Safari returns `Date`, see https://trac.webkit.org/browser/webkit/trunk/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLMediaElement.idl#L76.\r\n- Chrome is planning to return `Date`, see https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/html/media/HTMLMediaElement.idl?rcl=d9f90c9b2ea6dd588717556b1a2db9cd51c9f88b&l=64.",
